{"id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-variable.md","title":"Variable Set","display":"df-variable — Variable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-variable","aliases":["88-df-variable","88-df-var"],"display":"df-variable — Variable Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-symbol]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-variable</span><span>88-df-var</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variable — Variable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-variable-—-Variable-Set-$\\mathrm{Var}_S$\">df-variable — Variable Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (signature/language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sym}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Var}_S\\coloneqq\\{v_n^S:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Var}_S\\coloneqq\\{v_n^S:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(v_m^S=v_n^S\\leftrightarrow m=n)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Sym}_S=\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(v_m^S=v_n^S\\leftrightarrow m=n)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Sym}_S=\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-变量集（无穷集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_n^S\">\\(v_n^S\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>个变量（标准命名）；不同下标给出不同变量</li>\n<li>变量编码与签名符号集显式不交，避免同一记号同时被解析为变量和常量</li>\n<li>变量是公式和项的基本构成元素</li>\n<li>赋值函数将变量映射到结构论域中的元素</li>\n<li>变量集是逻辑语义的基础概念</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" href=\"?note=ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" title=\"88-df-assignment\">88-df-assignment</a> — 赋值</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a> — 自由变量</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae0e85fc0e149930\" href=\"?note=ae0e85fc0e149930\" title=\"88-df-bound-variable\">88-df-bound-var